tay in the job as Michigan's athletic director until the school finds a new athletic director, sources told ESPN on Wednesday.","published":"2026-11-25T14:32:52.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50592920/sources-manuel-stay-job-new-michigan-ad-hired","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Pete Thamel and Dan Wetzel","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Bottom 10 after Week 12: How the Bruins put the 'L' in UCLA","description":"While UCLA suffered its first loss, we still have a team looking for its first win -- and time is running out.","published":"2026-11-25T12:14:25.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50585901/bottom-10-week-12-ucla","type":"Story","byline":"Ryan McGee","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What went wrong for Michigan and Ohio State in 2026?","description":"Michigan and Ohio State have combined for nine losses entering Saturday's game.","published":"2026-11-25T12:25:19.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50576202/michigan-wolverines-ohio-state-buckeyes-went-wrong","type":"Story","byline":"Adam Rittenberg and Jake Trotter","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Best bets for rivalry week: Breaking down Michigan-OSU, Iowa-Nebraska and more","description":"Pamela Maldonado and Mark Zinno break down the best bets they see around college football for rivalry week.","published":"2026-11-25T11:46:21.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/50583508/college-football-betting-week-13-rivalry-week","type":"Story","byline":"Pamela Maldonado and Mark Zinno","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What are the conference title game clinching scenarios in Week 13?","description":"Plenty of spots are still up for grabs entering the final week of the regular season.","published":"2026-11-25T03:40:06.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50583399/conference-title-game-clinching-scenarios-week-13","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"College football betting: Should you still bet on Indiana to make the CFP?","description":"The Hoosiers dropped to No. 14 in the latest CPF rankings, but are they still a good bet to make the playoff?","published":"2026-11-25T04:16:33.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/50588403/2026-college-football-playoff-cfp-indiana-hoosiers","type":"Story","byline":"Pamela Maldonado","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Week 12 Anger Index: Indiana dropped how many spots?!","description":"Ranking the teams that should be most upset with the latest CFP rankings.","published":"2026-11-25T14:21:30.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50582371/cfp-ranking-2026-anger-index-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"David Hale","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Who's on the College Football Playoff bubble after committee's fourth ranking?","description":"A conference-by-conference look at which teams are contending for the playoff, who's close and who's out.","published":"2026-11-25T14:12:36.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50575185/cfp-playoff-2026-bubble-watch-week-fourth-ranking","type":"Story","byline":"Heather Dinich","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Why UTEP-NIU is 2026's most unglamorous Game of the Century","description":"The Week 13 game will mark the first time since at least 2000 that two teams that are winless against FBS opponents will meet in their final week of the regular season.","published":"2026-11-25T01:19:39.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50587546/utep-niu-college-football-game-century","type":"Story","byline":"J.J. Post","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Indiana falls from 12-team field in 4th CFP rankings; Horns, Vols leap Bama","description":"Defending champ Indiana fell six spots to No. 14, while Alabama was leaped by Texas and Tennessee and fell out of the top five in the latest CFP rankings Tuesday night.","published":"2026-11-25T07:42:16.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50588082/indiana-top-12-cfp-rankings-texas-tennessee-leap-alabama","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Andrea Adelson","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4833626/ben-roberts","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ben_Roberts_(linebacker)"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Ben Roberts (linebacker)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ben_Roberts_(linebacker)","description":"American football player (born 2004)","touched":"2026-11-14T07:37:26Z","intro":"Ben Roberts (born February 28, 2004) is an American football linebacker for the Texas Tech Red Raiders.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Roberts attended V.R. Eaton High School. He committed to play college football for the Texas Tech Red Raiders."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Roberts used the 2022 season to redshirt. In week two of the 2023 season, Roberts made his first career start, where he notched 12 tackles with two being for a loss, half a sack, and a forced fumble in a loss versus Oregon. He finished the 2023 season, recording a team-high 107 tackles with six and a half being for a loss, half a sack, an interception, and two forced fumbles. For his performance during the 2023 season, Roberts was named to the FWAA freshman all-American team, while also being named the Big 12 Defensive Freshman of the Year. He finished the 2024 season, notching 83 tackles with four and a half going for a loss. In week eleven of the 2025 season, Roberts brought in an interception in a victory versus Kansas State.\nTeaming up at linebacker with Big XII defensive Most Valuable Player Jacob Rodriguez, Roberts led the Red Raiders to a 34–7 win over BYU in the conference championship game on Dec. 6 at Cowboys Stadium. Roberts tallied two interceptions in the second half and was named the game’s MVP."}]}}